      "id": "class05_01_english_103_learn_1_7afd300f",
      "type": "poem",
      "text": "Boats sail on the rivers,\nAnd ships sail on the seas;\nBut clouds that sail across the sky\nAre prettier far than these.",
      "answer": null,
      "source": {
        "file": "01_LEARN\\01_LESSONS\\LESSONS.json",
        "page": 1
      },
      "order": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "class05_01_english_103_learn_2_c527c2fc",
      "type": "poem",
      "text": "There are bridges on the rivers,\nAs pretty as you please;\nBut the bow that bridges heaven,\nAnd overtops the trees,\nAnd builds a road from earth to sky,\nIs prettier far than these.\n– Christina Rossetti",
