      "text": "Note        •   \u0007Focus should be on the experience of travelling and\nnot on the place visited by the learners.\nto the\n•    \u0007Learners may share experiences of travelling to meet\nTeacher           their relatives.\n•     \u0007Revisit the rules of past tense before assigning this\nactivity.\n•      \u0007Facilitators are also encouraged to share their\ntravelling experiences with the learners.",
